<title>PHILIPPINES: Liberty Flour sets stock, cash dividends.</title>
<headline>Liberty Flour sets stock, cash dividends.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Flour Mills Inc said on Tuesday its board had approved a 50 centavo cash dividend and a 10.1928 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders as of May 27 are eligible for the cash dividend, which will be paid out on June 9. Shareholders as of June 6 are eligible for the stock dividend, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
